From: Winter21c <winter@localhost>
Subject: arm64: dts: qcom: sm8150-xiaomi-raphael: ultrawide S5K3L6 node on CCI1

The ultrawide module (stock DT `qcom,cam-sensor@3` = CAMU_*) is on CSIPHY3,
**CCI1 master0**, MCLK3 = tlmm gpio16, reset = tlmm gpio23, VDIG enable = tlmm
gpio34, with viodd + BOB + S8 + LDO17 as supplies.

This node lives on the second CCI controller added by patch 0007, so it only
becomes reachable once that node is in the tree.  It uses the shared Samsung
bring-up driver (camera/drivers/s5k3t2.c handles `samsung,s5k3l6` too), which
powers the module and reports the chip id at 16-bit register 0x0000 without
pretending to stream.

The address is a placeholder - the module has never been powered on mainline, so
the first run should use `keep_power=1` and scan the new CCI1 adapter for it.

Signed-off-by: Winter21c <winter@localhost>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-raphael.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8150-xiaomi-raphael.dts
@@ 	camera_vdig_front: regulator-camera-vdig-front {
 		vin-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
 	};
+
+	/* ultrawide module VDIG enable, stock DT CAMU_VDIG_EN */
+	camera_vdig_ultra: regulator-camera-vdig-ultra {
+		compatible = "regulator-fixed";
+		regulator-name = "camera_vdig_ultra";
+		regulator-min-microvolt = <1200000>;
+		regulator-max-microvolt = <1200000>;
+		enable-active-high;
+		gpio = <&tlmm 34 GPIO_ACTIVE_HIGH>;
+		vin-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
+	};
@@ 	cci1: cci@ac4b000 {
 		i2c-bus@0 {
 			reg = <0>;
 			clock-frequency = <400000>;
 			#address-cells = <1>;
 			#size-cells = <0>;
+
+			/* ultrawide: S5K3L6, CSIPHY3, MCLK3 gpio16,
+			 * reset gpio23, VDIG_EN gpio34 */
+			s5k3l6_ultra: camera@10 {
+				compatible = "samsung,s5k3l6";
+				reg = <0x10>;
+				reset-gpios = <&tlmm 23 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+				clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK3_CLK>;
+				clock-names = "xvclk";
+				assigned-clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK3_CLK>;
+				assigned-clock-rates = <19200000>;
+
+				avdd-supply = <&vreg_bob>;
+				dovdd-supply = <&camera_viodd_ldo>;
+				dvdd-supply = <&camera_vdig_ultra>;
+				vl17-supply = <&vreg_l17a_3p0>;
+				status = "okay";
+			};
 		};
 	};
